 **Formula:**
 A polygon with vertices $V = \{v_0, v_1, \dots, v_n\}$ is on the boundary if:
 $$ \forall v \in V, \quad |v_{\text{axis}} - \text{plane}| \le \text{eps} $$
-Where $v_{\text{axis}}$ is the component of vertex $v$ along the specified axis.
